  "step_3": "The decision reason requires considering outcomes with probability less than 20% and increasing their weight by 10 percentage points. In this decision problem, both lotteries have outcomes with probabilities of 50% and 100%, so no outcome qualifies for the adjustment. Therefore, the decision reason is not applicable in any meaningful way to the actual outcomes. The individual’s verbal report does not mention any such adjustment, nor does it reference low-probability outcomes or any modified weighting. Instead, the reasoning focuses on certainty and the possibility of investment to achieve 1000€, which is a different reasoning path (based on risk aversion or investment potential). Since the decision reason is not triggered by the data and not referenced in the justification, the individual did not use the decision reason. The absence of any mention or application of the rule confirms that it was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
}

